{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17219240","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17219240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721924001:1":{"text":"아가씨, 손님을 모셔 왔습니다.","source_cn":"小姐，人我带到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A1C1D432DCD96B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721924002:1":{"text":"수고했어, 두 분이 실비 부인을 만나고 싶다고 하셨나요?","source_cn":"辛苦你了。两位，听说你们有事想求见茜茜夫人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE408896768DD0083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721924003:1":{"text":"네, 네! 혹시 실비 부인이십니까?","source_cn":"正、正是！您、您就是茜茜夫人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911628FB92A80F32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721924004:1":{"text":"뭔가 오해가 있는 모양이네요. 제 이름은 클로에랍니다. 실비 부인은 잠시 저택에 머물고 계시는 손님이지요.","source_cn":"两位误会了。我叫克萝伊，茜茜夫人是我的座上宾，目前正暂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4679CC661A3A911C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721924005:1":{"text":"저와 실비 부인의 관계는... 어떻게 보면 제가 보호자라고 할 수 있겠네요.","source_cn":"我和茜茜夫人的关系……我算是她某种意义上的监护人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB13FC709E1D22473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721924006:1":{"text":"실비 부인의 시간은 매우 소중해요. 정식으로 소개하기 전에 우선... 여러분이 가져온 선물이 부인의 마음에 드는지 확인부터 해야 할 것 같네요.","source_cn":"茜茜夫人的时间非常宝贵。在正式引荐之前，我必须先确认一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6813D9D2E9F9C33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721924007:1":{"text":"정성껏 만들긴 했는데... 마음에 들었으면 좋겠네요.","source_cn":"这、这是我们精心制作的……希望夫人能喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22564F50F5D1B8A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::2":{"text":"고양이 장난감","source_cn":"逗猫棒","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B767A32C1AEC70F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721924008:1":{"text":"음... 좋은 재료로 잘 만드셨네요. 특히 이 깃털! 부드럽고 탄력이 있어요.","source_cn":"嗯……选材考究，制作精良，尤其是这根羽毛，柔软，灵活，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x021D570511027E31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721924009:1":{"text":"분명 좋아할 거예요.","source_cn":"我想，夫人一定会满意的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x035A1365972F67D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721924010:1":{"text":"실비 부인